# ========================================================
# Ethiopian Orthodox Bible App - Environment Configuration
# ========================================================

# 1. HUGGING FACE AMHARIC TTS (Meta MMS - facebook/mms-tts-amh) [Optional]
# Generates realistic neural Amharic audio. If left blank, public inference is used.
# Get your free token at: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# EXPO_PUBLIC_HF_TOKEN=hf_your_huggingface_token_here

# 2. ADDIS AI AMHARIC TEXT-TO-SPEECH [Optional]
# Custom Ethiopian AI startup model (addis-voice-2).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_ADDIS_AI_API_KEY=your_addis_ai_api_key_here

# 3. SECURE BACKEND PROXY [Optional]
# If you deploy server/tts-server.js to Render/Railway/Fly.io:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_TTS_API_URL=https://your-tts-proxy.onrender.com/api/tts

# 4. ZERO CONFIGURATION FALLBACK (100% Offline)
# If none of the above keys are provided, the app automatically and seamlessly
# uses on-device Google Speech Services (am-ET for Amharic, en-US for English).
# Works completely offline inside the Android APK with zero data usage!
